[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0009","text":"记者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0010","text":"──在本地，昨天举行了\n每年例行的放河灯活动"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0019","text":"记者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0020","text":"温暖的灯火铺满了整条河面──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0030","text":"哇……\n好美……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0040","text":"真梦幻啊……\n烛光温柔地闪烁着……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0050","text":"──嗯，也许不错"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0060","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0070","text":"晚上大家聚在一起，\n只靠烛光度过一段时光，怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0080","text":"一定会是个很美好的夜晚"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0090","text":"呵呵……嗯……！\n我也想试试……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0100","text":"那好，我这就去邀请大家"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
